id=ternak_tt
name=Ternak TT — Zygisk Fresh Persona
version=v1.0.14
versionCode=114
author=diru768
description=Zygisk device spoofer targeting TikTok (musically/trill/lite) + Grab Passenger. 6-layer Java hook + 78 native prop spoofs + L7 TYPED spoof tables + companion fork+setns bind mount overlay. v1.0.14: post-fs-data early seed (new `ternak-tt seed` subcommand generates identity + mount overlay BEFORE Zygisk loads — fixes v1.0.13 first-boot race where first target pid got 0/6 mounts). Companion BIND_ENTRIES extended with Android 11+ canonical paths (/odm/etc/build.prop, /product/etc/build.prop, /system_ext/etc/build.prop) alongside legacy layouts — fixes 3-skip on POCO F3 / MIUI. Skip counter now split into skip_src (bug) vs skip_dst (device doesn't have that partition, expected). Auto-summarizer on Action tap. Works on Zygisk-Next / HMA-OSS.
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/diru768/ternak-tt/main/update.json
